Aeron persistent-subscription image release candidate

Applies to the Aeron C sources bundled with rusteron-archive 0.2.16.
Recovered from the integration worktree; tracked upstream work: https://github.com/awesomepandapig/mmx/issues/22

Persistent subscriptions acquire replay/live images but omit matching releases
when cleaning up subscriptions and abandoning a live image after position checks.
This candidate adds those releases. It has NOT been enabled in Cargo.toml and
requires sustained failover/reconnect testing and upstream ownership review before
production use. The existing consumer client replacement workaround remains needed.

To check/apply against a disposable unpacked rusteron-archive 0.2.16 source copy:
  patch --dry-run -p1 -d /path/to/rusteron-archive-0.2.16 < persistent-subscription-release.patch
  patch -p1 -d /path/to/rusteron-archive-0.2.16 < persistent-subscription-release.patch

Do not patch the shared Cargo registry cache. A reviewed deployment must use a
pinned upstream fix or an explicit reproducible dependency override, then exercise
image lifetime, subscription restart and native cleanup under sanitizers.

--- a/aeron/aeron-archive/src/main/c/client/aeron_archive_persistent_subscription.c
+++ b/aeron/aeron-archive/src/main/c/client/aeron_archive_persistent_subscription.c
@@ -744,6 +744,11 @@
         aeron_async_add_subscription_cancel(
             persistent_subscription->context->aeron,
             persistent_subscription->add_replay_subscription);
+    }
+
+    if (NULL != persistent_subscription->replay_image)
+    {
+        aeron_image_release(persistent_subscription->replay_image);
     }
 
     if (NULL != persistent_subscription->replay_subscription)
@@ -764,6 +769,11 @@
         aeron_async_add_subscription_cancel(
             persistent_subscription->context->aeron,
             persistent_subscription->add_live_subscription);
+    }
+
+    if (NULL != persistent_subscription->live_image)
+    {
+        aeron_image_release(persistent_subscription->live_image);
     }
 
     if (NULL != persistent_subscription->live_subscription)
@@ -2201,6 +2211,7 @@
             {
                 if (live_position < persistent_subscription->position)
                 {
+                    aeron_image_release(image);
                     aeron_archive_persistent_subscription_clean_up_live_subscription(persistent_subscription);
                     aeron_archive_persistent_subscription_transition(persistent_subscription, FAILED);
 
@@ -2219,6 +2230,7 @@
                 }
                 else if (live_position > persistent_subscription->position)
                 {
+                    aeron_image_release(image);
                     aeron_archive_persistent_subscription_clean_up_live_subscription(persistent_subscription);
                     aeron_archive_persistent_subscription_refresh_recording_descriptor(persistent_subscription);
 
